  "details": "Additional Options for Owners of Worlds like:\n\n- Force Close User Placed Portals \n\n(if the World Portal is inappropriate and/or people are trying to Troll with them)\n\n- Refresh Instance \n\n(Force Rejoin All Users)\n\n- Force Close Any Instance Type\n\n(As long as you are the Owner of the World, be it Friends, Friends+, Group, Group Public, Group+)\n\n- Instance Muting/Deafen Users\n\n(Similar to Server Mute/Deafen Users in Discord)\n\ni think these will help with finer moderation of Worlds for Strictly the Owner of Said world and maybe Groups too.\n\nThat is all i can think of at the moment.",
